<template>
  <div class="blog-home">
    <section class="banner"><div class="orb orb-one"/><div class="orb orb-two"/><div class="banner-copy"><span>WORK NOTES</span><h1>把解决过的问题，<br>沉淀成可复用的经验。</h1><p>项目实践 · 故障排查 · 工程方法</p></div><div class="scroll-hint">SCROLL ↓</div></section>
    <section class="content-shell">
